      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'At first, Elora assumed she''d broken the map until she read this narration
    and realized it was a part of the game''s design all along.

    

    She
    then praised the game for its insightful and witty commentary into the nature
    of video game structure and its examination of structural narrative tropes.


    So
    now that you''re here, what do you think?

    

    Isn''t this a fun and
    unique place to be?

    

    Why don''t we take a minute just to drink it
    all in!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
